, "padTop": "0px", "padBot": "0px", "bgc": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)", "cwPad": ["0px", "0px", "0px", "0px"], "cwStyle": "padding-top: calc(0vmax / 10); padding-bottom: calc(0vmax / 10);", "bg": null, "overlay": null, "inFooter": false, "blocks": [{"id": "fe-block-88540dfd25203833cb8f", "area": "3 / 2 / 6 / 10", "z": "1", "rect": [23, 2383, 330, 75], "type": "sqs-block website-component-block html-block", "jc": "flex-start", "ai": "normal", "fd": "column", "pad": "0px", "disp": "block", "html": "<h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-fs=\"25.3542px\" data-lh=\"24.8682px\" data-m=\"0px 0px\" data-col=\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--black\" data-color=\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\" data-td=\"none\" data-fw=\"500\">Crossing Fire &amp; Ice <br></span><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--darkAccent\" data-color=\"rgb(147, 149, 152)\" data-td=\"none\" data-fw=\"500\">A Journey Through Iceland with Vandra</span></h2>", "htmlRect": [23, 2383, 330, 75]}, {"id": "fe-block-1809ce1be80a27da70dc", "area": "7 / 2 / 13 / 9", "z": "0", "rect": [23, 2482, 289, 194], "type": "sqs-block website-component-block html-block", "jc": "flex-start", "ai": "normal", "fd": "column", "pad": "0px", "disp": "block", "html": "<h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-fs=\"15.8051px\" data-lh=\"16.1341px\" data-m=\"0px 0px\" data-col=\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--darkAccent\" data-color=\"rgb(147, 149, 152)\" data-td=\"none\" data-fw=\"500\">A path less paved<br></span>In early spring, Ali and Metin set out on a trek across southern Iceland — a place where terrain shifts from lava fields to glacial plains in a single afternoon. Their goal: to reach the edges of Vatnajökull, Europe’s largest glacier, carrying Metins 1-year-old daughter with them. What they found was not just a landscape shaped by fire and ice, but a kind of calm in the chaos. A stillness that made the wind and snow feel like old companions.</h4>", "htmlRect": [23, 2482, 289, 194]}, {"id": "fe-block-6cb2812e1c5b15f347d5", "area": "13 / 2 / 21 / 9", "z": "1", "rect": [23, 2676, 289, 226], "type": "sqs-block website-component-block html-block", "jc": "flex-start", "ai": "normal", "fd": "column", "pad": "0px", "disp": "block", "html": "<h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-fs=\"15.8051px\" data-lh=\"16.1341px\" data-m=\"0px 0px\" data-col=\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--darkAccent\" data-color=\"rgb(147, 149, 152)\" data-td=\"none\" data-fw=\"500\">Built for the wild, shaped for life<br></span>Crossing glacial tongues and tracing ancient volcanic ridges, they discovered something unexpected: that the more remote the terrain, the more connected they felt. \"It was never about conquering the landscape,\" Metin added. \"It was about moving through it together.\" From Reykjavik to Skaftafell and beyond, their journey wasn’t just about the destination — it was a story written one step at a time. Vandra came with them, but more importantly, helped keep the adventure theirs.</h4>", "htmlRect": [23, 2676, 289, 226]}, {"id": "fe-block-yui_3_17_2_1_1748087209581_5029", "area": "20 / 2 / 25 / 10", "z": "2", "rect": [23, 2872, 330, 145], "type": "sqs-block website-component-block html-block", "jc": "flex-start", "ai": "normal", "fd": "column", "pad": "0px", "disp": "block", "html": "<h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-fs=\"15.8051px\" data-lh=\"16.1341px\" data-m=\"0px 0px\" data-col=\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--darkAccent\" data-color=\"rgb(147, 149, 152)\" data-td=\"none\" data-fw=\"500\">Moving through contrasts<br></span>The trip was as unpredictable as Iceland itself. One moment under blue skies, the next in sideways rain. What remained constant was their pace — and their gear. The Vandra™ Glacier kept their equipment protected through each shift, with its weatherproof outer, ergonomic frame, and modular compartments allowing them to adjust on the go. </h4>", "htmlRect": [23, 2872, 330, 145]}, {"id": "fe-block-yui_3_17_2_1_1748087209581_13203", "area": "26 / 2 / 41 / 10", "z": "3", "rect": [23, 3042, 330, 360], "type": "sqs-block website-component-block image-block", "jc": "center", "ai": "normal", "fd": "column", "pad": "0px", "disp": "block", "img": {"src": "DJI_0123.JPG", "fit": "cover", "radius": "0px", "pos": "50% 50%", "w": 330, "h": 360, "wrapRadius": "20px", "wrapOverflow": "hidden", "wrap": [23, 3042, 330, 360]}}], "kind": "fluid", "rows": 45, "rowH": "24px", "gap": "0px", "feH": 1187}, {"id": "6831be844d28fd295b1a0394", "theme": "bright-inverse", "cls": "page-section full-bleed-section layout-engine-section background-width--full-bleed section-height--custom content-width--wide horizontal-alignment--center vertical-alignment--middle bright-inverse", "style": null, "rect": [3522, 812], "minHeight": "812px", "padTop": "0px", "padBot": "0px", "bgc": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(238, 238, 238)", "cwPad": ["0px", "0px", "0px", "0px"], "cwStyle": "padding-top: calc(0vmax / 10); padding-bottom: calc(0vmax / 10);", "bg": null, "overlay": null, "inFooter": false, "blocks": [{"id": "fe-block-59c453a1411d313ca91f", "area": "2 / 2 / 13 / 10", "z": "1", "rect": [23, 3711, 330, 264], "type": "sqs-block website-component-block html-block", "jc": "flex-start", "ai": "normal", "fd": "column", "pad": "0px", "disp": "block", "html": "<h1 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-fs=\"30px\" data-lh=\"27.0259px\" data-m=\"0px 0px\" data-col=\"rgb(238, 238, 238)\">Share your Vandra™ story.<br><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--darkAccent\" data-color=\"rgb(147, 149, 152)\" data-td=\"none\" data-fw=\"500\">Enjoy deals and offers.</span></h1>", "htmlRect": [23, 3711, 330, 81]}, {"id": "fe-block-7e3fbd2e73e9d2f06c22", "area": "12 / 2 / 16 / 9", "z": "0", "rect": [23, 3951, 289, 97], "type": "sqs-block website-component-block html-block", "jc": "flex-start", "ai": "normal", "fd": "column", "pad": "0px", "disp": "block", "html": "<h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-fs=\"15.8051px\" data-lh=\"16.1341px\" data-m=\"0px 0px\" data-col=\"rgb(238, 238, 238)\">Share your own Vandra™ stories and become part of the special community. By joining, you'll gain access to exclusive deals and offers designed just for you.  Your voice matters, and we look forward to hearing your journey with Vandra™.</h4>", "htmlRect": [23, 3951, 289, 97]}, {"id": "fe-block-cd7c2126eb1db7084e8f", "area": "17 / 2 / 19 / 10", "z": "2", "rect": [23, 4072, 330, 48], "type": "sqs-block website-component-block html-block", "jc": "flex-start", "ai": "normal", "fd": "column", "pad": "0px", "disp": "block", "html": "<p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-fs=\"11px\" data-lh=\"13px\" data-m=\"0px 0px\" data-col=\"rgb(238, 238, 238)\"><a href=\"/community\" data-color=\"rgb(238, 238, 238)\" data-td=\"none\" data-fw=\"500\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--darkAccent\" data-color=\"rgb(147, 149, 152)\" data-td=\"none\" data-fw=\"500\">Submit you stories <strong data-fw=\"700\">→</strong></span></a></p>", "htmlRect": [23, 4072, 330, 13]}], "kind": "fluid", "rows": 20, "rowH": "24px", "gap": "0px", "feH": 481}, {"id": "6722610f83a465349885c9c7", "theme": "white-bold", "cls": "page-section full-bleed-section layout-engine-section background-width--full-bleed section-height--custom content-width--wide horizontal-alignment--center vertical-alignment--middle white-bold", "style": "min-height: 1vh;", "rect": [4418, 388], "minHeight": "0px", "padTop": "0px", "padBot": "0px", "bgc": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)", "cwPad": ["0.812px", "0.812px", "0px", "0px"], "cwStyle": "padding-top: calc(1vmax / 10); padding-bottom: calc(1vmax / 10);", "bg": null, "overlay": null, "inFooter": true, "blocks": [{"id": "fe-block-yui_3_17_2_1_1747769784074_8896", "area": "3 / 2 / 5 / 10", "z": "6", "rect": [23, 4467, 330, 48], "type": "sqs-block website-component-block newsletter-block", "jc": "flex-start", "ai": "normal", "fd": "column", "pad": "0px", "disp": "block", "form": {"fields": [{"cls": "news